  "content": "<h1>修改版生態域源 - TerraBlender</h1><p>修改版生態域源 - TerraBlender 為修改版生態域源和 TerraBlender 之間增添了相容性。它支援所有依賴於 TerraBlender 的模組，包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Biomes O' Plenty</li>\n<li>Oh The Biomes We've Gone</li>\n<li>Regions Unexplored</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>問題回報</h2><p>目前沒有新的相容性問題或錯誤回報。請在 <a href=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-modifiedbiomesourceterrablender/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上回報，以便我們進行修復。</p>\n<h2>支援版本</h2><p>🟩 26.1-26.1.2 / 🟩 1.21.1 / 🟥 1.21-1.21.11 / 🟩 1.20.1</p>\n<p>🟩 已支援<br>\n🟥 已停止支援<br>\n🟨 開發中<br>\n🟪 考慮中</p>\n<h2>備註</h2><p>歡迎在模組包、影片、直播或類似媒體中使用。如果你喜歡這個模組，也可以考慮給予經濟上的支持，我將不勝感激。</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/github-plural_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 GitHub 上查看我\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fmahmudindev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/available/modrinth_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Modrinth 上可用\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@oreno69\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/youtube-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 YouTube 上觀看我的影片\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/cuYgFmq3kz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/discord-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Discord 上與我聊天\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mahmudindes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/patreon-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252foreno\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/kofi-singular-alt_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上支持我\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsaweria.co%252fmahmudindes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/barraIhsan/devins-badges/blob/saweria/assets/compact-minimal/donate/saweria-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Saweria 上支持我\"></a>\n</div>\n<p><br></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dimensionfixer\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionfixer/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/dimensionfixer/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Dimension Fixer\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dimensionlink\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionlink/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/dimensionlink/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Dimension Link\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/worldportal\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-worldportal/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/worldportal/icon.png?raw=true\" alt=\"World Portal\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fMiqj0P3U\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-vanillaworld/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/vanillaworld/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Vanilla World\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/morecatvariants\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-morecatvariants/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/morecatvariants/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"More Cat Variants\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/passengersportalfix\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-passengersportalfix/blob/ma